# The chest in the room below (Crossroads_10, scene 11: position x 6.7 y 12.8, on the ledge whose top is y 11, Knight height 12.39,
# x 2 to 12). From the Crest at x 38: back along the floor, over the 3.9-high pillar at x 18.3 to 18.8, up the plate at x 12.9 to 14.4
# (top 6.7) and the ledge, then a swing at the chest from x 9.5 (a nail strike with the Knight inside its reach box opens it).
at 37.9 3.39
walk 21.0
leap 20.2 left 44 16.5 3.39 cross 30
walk 16.0
hop 13.6 8.05 lead 0.25
walk 13.1
hop 10.5 12.39 lead 0
walk 9.5
hold left until expr i32(HK_PLAYER_FACING) < 0 timeout 20       # face the chest
press square                                                    # the swing opens it
wait until HK_CHESTS_OPENED ge 1 timeout 120
wait 60
